        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Redford Your New Beginning in Adamstown. \r\n \r\nPlease register your interest for future updates or contact Savills on 01 618 1300.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Redford, the latest development of contemporary homes by Evara. Located in the heart of Adamstown is this elegant collection of 2, 3 & 4 bedroom houses which is sure to appeal to a variety of home owners from young  to growing families alike. Redford effortlessly combines urban village living and access to top class transport infrastructure, along with an abundance of green space. \r\n \r\nUnmatched Connectivity and Accessibility \r\n\r\nJust 15 km west of Dublin City Centre and southwest of the charming Lucan Village, Redford' s prime location ensures effortless travel to Dublin City Centre and beyond. Situated moments from Adamstown Train Station, residents can enjoy swift and convenient commutes-just 20 minutes by train or less than 25 minutes by car via the N4. Regular bus services further enhance connectivity, while Dublin Airport is a mere 20-minute drive via the M50, offering easy access for both work and leisure.\r\n \r\nContemporary Homes Built for Modern Living\r\n\r\nThe homes at Redford are meticulously crafted to meet the highest standards of quality and design. Each property features stylish, bespoke kitchens, bathrooms with premium feature tiling, fitted wardrobes by BeSpace, and a BER A2 rating for superior energy efficiency. These homes combine elegance, sustainability, and comfort, making them the perfect choice for modern living.\r\n \r\nA Community with Everything You Need\r\n\r\nLiving at Redford means becoming part of a dynamic community with amenities to suit every lifestyle. Just a short walk from your doorstep is The Crossings, a vibrant urban village that offers a variety of retail and dining options. Flagship stores like Tesco and Aldi sit alongside well known offerings from McCabes Pharmacy, Kerrigans Butchers and The Grafton Barber amongst others. Whether you' re shopping, dining, working out, or simply unwinding, The Crossings provides everything you need for a convenient and fulfilling daily life.\r\n \r\nEndless Opportunities for Outdoor Living\r\n\r\nRedford residents can enjoy the over 200 acres of parkland nearby, complete with sports facilities and play areas, while scenic walking trails along the River Liffey and the Grand Canal are also easily accessible. Whether you prefer a leisurely stroll, an active workout, or a day out with family, Redford offers an abundance of outdoor spaces to relax and recharge.\r\n \r\nEducation for Every Stage\r\n\r\nFamilies at Redford benefit from a wide selection of educational institutions in the Lucan and Adamstown areas. These include esteemed primary schools like St. Mary' s Boys National School and Adamstown Castle Educate Together National School, which offers an inclusive, child-focused curriculum. Secondary education is equally impressive, with options such as Adamstown Community College and ColÃƒÂ¡iste Cois Life, an Irish-speaking school known for academic excellence.\r\n \r\nDiscover your perfect, modern home amidst a thriving community at Redford-a place where contemporary living meets timeless convenience."
      },
